@page "/advanced/087"
@rendermode InteractiveServer

<h1>Exercise 087 - ComponentStatePreservationAcrossRenderMode</h1>

<p>The prerender pass computes the report and persists it; the interactive pass
   adopts it. The load counter below is per circuit, so a correct implementation
   shows 1 after a reload, not 2.</p>

<Ex087_ComponentStatePreservationAcrossRenderMode Load="LoadReport" />

<p>loads this pass: @_loads</p>

@code {
    private int _loads;

    private Ex087_ComponentStatePreservationAcrossRenderMode.ReportData LoadReport()
    {
        _loads++;
        return new Ex087_ComponentStatePreservationAcrossRenderMode.ReportData("quarterly", 128);
    }
}
